[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3713944011","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114636#issuecomment-3713944011","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114636","id":3713944011,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dXknL","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-06T09:38:59Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T09:39:10Z","body":"This kind of error macros is meant to be used to surface engine bugs, not user mistakes. If it's a mistake to try to open \"Favorites\" in the filesystem, it should simply not be an option. Then the `ERR_FAIL_COND` checks can be kept but should only trigger if we break the protections put in place to prevent users from triggering this state.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3713944011/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3714562019","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114636#issuecomment-3714562019","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114636","id":3714562019,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dZ7fj","user":{"login":"aaronp64","id":136198872,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB462A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136198872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronp64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-06T12:41:25Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T12:41:25Z","body":"> If it's a mistake to try to open \"Favorites\" in the filesystem, it should simply not be an option.\r\n\r\nThere's two ways to access these actions - through the right-click menu, and selecting + keyboard shortcut.  The right click menu is already disabled for Favorites, while selecting can still be used for other actions, like left/right arrows to collapse/expand Favorites.  This leaves the possibility that users can select Favorites, then press the keyboard shortcut for an invalid action - what should happen in this case?  I went with the error macros so the action isn't attempted, and with the error there's at least some indication to the user why nothing happened, in case they thought something else was selected.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3714562019/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3716375145","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114636#issuecomment-3716375145","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114636","id":3716375145,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dg2Jp","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-06T21:11:43Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T21:11:43Z","body":"In such cases the editor usually will just returns silently. It makes sense, the shortcut is specifically tied to the context menu option, and the option is disabled or does not even show, so it shouldn't do anything.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3716375145/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"e